{"id":"kucha","lemma":"куча","pos":"noun","rank":798,"glosses":["heap, pile","a lot (a large amount)","heap"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9c/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%83%D1%87%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%83%D1%87%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"кучи","plural":"кучи"},"examples":[{"text":"Это куча работы.","en":"It's a lot of work.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"work","l":"работа"}]},{"text":"У нас куча времени.","en":"We've got loads of time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274862","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"us","l":"мы"},null,{"g":"time","l":"время"}]},{"text":"У тебя куча друзей.","en":"You have lots of friends.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"close friend","l":"друг"}]},{"text":"У нас вчера была куча проблем.","en":"We had a lot of problems yesterday.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"us","l":"мы"},{"g":"yesterday"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,null]},{"text":"У меня куча долгов.","en":"I have tons of debt.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274780","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"debt","l":"долг"}]}]}